      "created_at": "2016-01-26T06:38:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Absent any specific ruling/errata, when a card \"restores\" something to X HP, does that count as healing?</p><p>If it does, we found a hi-larious combo :-)&nbsp; We were in the Court of Blood, and Unhallowed Halls was out, preventing all non-vampire healing.&nbsp; The vampires spent the majority of the game attacking Greazer's Impeccable Pompadour, driving it further and further into the negative.&nbsp; And every turn, Greazer looked at his totally non-perfect hair, and cried for 3 HP of damage, but unable to fix his hair.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:46:14.342Z",
